WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.100 --> 00:00:06.000
Devil Facial Tumour Disease is a very strange and bizarre new type of cancer

00:00:06.000 --> 00:00:07.100
It usually starts off

00:00:07.100 --> 00:00:12.700
as a small tumour, a little nodule, on the
lips or inside the mouth, or somewhere on the face

00:00:12.800 --> 00:00:19.400
however, this rapidly, within the course of a few weeks to months, develops into a massive ulcerating tumour.

00:00:19.800 --> 00:00:23.800
As the tumours grow especially when
they're inside the oral cavity, inside the mouth

00:00:23.800 --> 00:00:26.400
the tumours can remove dentition,

00:00:26.500 --> 00:00:31.000
can displace bones from the jaw so it is
very hard for the animal to feed

00:00:31.000 --> 00:00:35.200
and it's hard to compete for food as
being scavengers with other Tasmanian devils.

00:00:35.300 --> 00:00:39.600
But also because it's a cancer, it is
creating a lot of damage in the internal organs.

00:00:39.700 --> 00:00:44.500
So I think there is a combination of factors
that makes that animal die within the year.

